Story layout in all 5 encounter-01.json:
- plans per turn [2,2,2,3,1], maxTurns 6;
- starter deck: 4 Inspect, 3 Block, 1 Roll Back;
- unlocks: turn 1 policy, turn 3 Escalate, turn 4 Coffee;
- the per-pathway step orders in spec 2.3 (turn 1 = 2 safe plans; no turn with 2 risky plans), plus a layout-guard test.

Mastery rule A plus a middle grade:
- proof row: R 'Caught with proof';
- another red row: R 'Caught';
- plain row: P 'Right stop, wrong line' (added to MISS_REASONS);
- no mark: R.
Practice records clues but never grades them. HistoryEntry.proof is validated in save.ts.

stages.acceptance:
All gates are green: tsc, eslint, vitest, next build, check:bundles, e2e:first-five A1-A17 plus the new B1-B6.

In balance.test (1000 story seeds, 200 dailies), all 5 pathways:
- careful 3 stars between 40% and 70% in story and daily;
- careful wins 100% and passes at least 95% of dailies;
- triage bot at least careful + 10 in the story;
- careful runs with a triage turn at least 60%;
- guess-flag 3 stars at most 1.5%;
- oracle 3 stars 100%;
- approve-all, block-all and escalate-unknown at most 5%.

The harness run with variants/phase2a-built.json against the built repo reproduces dir-final-content.txt within 1 point. The golden audit shows exactly the diffs listed per step. A pre-2a daily save resumes under the old rules. Pre-2a story saves start fresh with history and skills kept.

